// dat/water.js — the Plane of Water.
// C ref: dat/water.lua
//
// A level that is one solid sea. The hero arrives in an air bubble in the
// leftmost third; the portal to the Astral Plane floats in a bubble in the
// rightmost third. Bubbles are generated by special code in mkmaze.c
// (setup_waterlevel), not by the script.

